SUMMARY:AK27 · Rig prep: finish before the winter loop
DESCRIPTION:Before leaving on the Nov–Apr loop:\n• Install bay locks 
 (keyed alike\, not CH751)\n• Power door locks + redo cab weatherstrippi
 ng in the same job\n• Move the killswitch from the Seabreeze\n• Buy G
 armin inReach\, set up MapShare\n• RV insurance: personal-property limi
 t + theft from unattended vehicle\n• Confirm Good Sam covers Yukon\, BC
 \, Alaska\n• Photograph/serialize gear\n• Passport valid past Aug 202
 7\n• Buy collapsible water jugs
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:AK27 · Rig prep: finish before the winter loop
TRIGGER:-P6DT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
