SUMMARY:AK27 · Book Denali: Riley Creek campground + park bus
DESCRIPTION:Denali reservations open Dec 1 for the next summer.\nreserved
 enali.com · 800-622-7275\n\nFor D+33–34 (Jul 10–11 if leaving Jun 7)
 .\nRiley Creek A site: $55/night (2026 published)\, fits up to 40'\, no h
 ookups (none anywhere in the park). Free dump at Riley Creek Mercantile.\
 nBackup: Savage River\, same price\, 13 mi in.\nAlso book the transit bus
  for D+34.
