SUMMARY:AK27 · Check Parks Canada 2027 launch dates + Alaska State Parks
  openings
DESCRIPTION:1) Parks Canada announces launch dates around December. 2026 
 launches: Kluane Jan 20\, Jasper Jan 27\, Prince Albert Jan 30 (8 am loca
 l). Move the three AK27 Parks Canada placeholders to the real 2027 dates.
  Find Elk Island's date.\n\n2) Alaska State Parks: several campgrounds di
 d not open in 2026 (staffing) — including Byers Lake and Chilkoot Lake.
  Check 2027 openings. Window is ~7 months ahead via Reserve America.
