SUMMARY:AK27 · Book Skagway\, Haines\, Seward RV sites
DESCRIPTION:(2026 published rates\; dates assume a Jun 7 departure)\n• 
 Skagway\, Pullen Creek RV — D+21 (Jun 28). $75\, 30A + water\, dump at 
 entrance\, next to the ferry. Books year-round.\n• Haines Hitch-Up RV 
 — D+22 (Jun 29). 92 full-hookup sites. (Chilkoot Lake campground was cl
 osed in 2026.)\n• Seward city waterfront (Campspot\, reservations REQUI
 RED) — D+41–43 (Jul 18–20). RV dry $45\, premium $70. Alt: Miller's
  Landing\, beachfront full hookups.\n• Optional: Heritage RV Park\, Hom
 er Spit — ~$72 full hookups. City campgrounds on the Spit are first-com
 e only.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:AK27 · Book Skagway\, Haines\, Seward RV sites
TRIGGER:-PT15H
END:VALARM
