SUMMARY:AK27 · ENGINE SWAP DECISION (before anything comes apart)
DESCRIPTION:Once the 3VZ is out\, you're committed. Decide with:\n• 7\,
 000+ miles of 3VZ data from the winter loop\n• Doug or pro-shop availab
 ility\n• Driveshaft lead time\n• ToyOnlySwaps late-May slot\n• The 
 departure dial\nSwap order: suspension to ride height → engine/trans 
 → exhaust → measure driveshaft → hard local loop → Eugene run.\nN
 o swap: suspension + service\, build the 3VZ spares kit.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
